{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39836","headline":"赠池州张太守 · 殷文圭","name":"赠池州张太守","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"神珠无纇玉无瑕，七叶簪貂汉相家。\n阵面奔星破犀象，笔头飞电跃龙蛇。\n绦帏夜坐穷三史，红斾春行到九华。\n只怕池人留不住，别迁征镇拥高牙。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"殷文圭","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39836.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39836","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}